# Both findings live under /usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages, the
# *system* Python bundled in the pinned python:3.11-slim base image (see
# docker/Dockerfile's PYTHON_BASE_IMAGE comment). The app runs out of
# /opt/venv, which PATH puts first, so this copy of pip/setuptools/wheel is
# never invoked at runtime. Not fixable from this repo without patching the
# base image directly; Dependabot's docker ecosystem entry will flag base
# image bumps that may resolve these upstream.

# setuptools' vendored jaraco.context — path traversal via malicious tar archives
CVE-2026-23949

# setuptools' vendored wheel — code execution via malicious wheel file
CVE-2026-24049
